Date: Mon, 18 May 2026 14:18:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Unlock GPL build: drivers, MQTT, Plot3D, ImageView, DBC, XY
 Plot, Console Export
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Patches upstream Serial-Studio v3.2.7 so the GPLv3 build exposes:
- All IO drivers: Audio, CANBus, Modbus, USB, HID, Process (plus stock UART/Net/BLE)
- MQTT publisher/subscriber (Qt6::Mqtt, built from source separately)
- Plot 3D widget (Qt Quick3D scatter)
- Image View widget (live camera/image feed; export-to-zip stays Pro)
- DBC importer (CAN database file parsing)
- XY Plot mode (phase diagrams via dataset xAxisId)
- Binary Direct mode (FrameDetection::NoDelimiters — already in upstream GPL)
- Synchronous Console Export to per-device .txt files

Stays Pro-only: license UI, MDF4 export, ImageExport zip recording,
AI assistant, gRPC API for unlocked drivers. See PATCHES.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
